# Historical boundaries for constituency audiences and Crown conduct:
# Abrahamian, Iran Between Two Revolutions, ch. 5, pp. 249–267; Azimi,
# The Quest for Democracy in Iran, ch. 3, pp. 118–153. Qualitative values are
# scenario evaluations, not historical polling or measurements.
# Dynamic SPD comparison: status.scene.dry puts date, resources, the party's
# position, and government on Main; its Politics and Polls subscenes separate
# party organization from electoral support.
title: Status
new-page: true
is-special: true

